  "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/287) by Oskar Grunning (Bitbucket: [sQVe](https://bitbucket.org/sQVe), GitHub: [sQVe](https://github.com/sQVe)).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nHey,\n\nOne thing that is pulling me away from using ART, instead of RawTherapee, is that it doesn’t support the Fujifilm X-T5. I’ve tried adding values to the camconst file but that didn’t solve my issue. All RAWs have a thick black line at the top of the image.\n\nI am also curious on when the camera, and other newer Fujifilm, might get support?\n\nCheers for all the effort and work you’ve put into ART!\n",
